    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjN_kxdiMuUTPQlyGyxatATHfTjH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这班儿非上不可吗？听听来自宇宙大厂牛马的参悟~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>When哥儿：在某互联网大厂“拧螺丝”</span></p><span></span><p><span>七昔：搞文旅的“脚后跟”网易音乐人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期摘要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a> 一个牛马在北京的十年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 职场甩锅大混子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 指手画脚大明白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 被领导误会了怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2004">33:24</a> 职场阴阳人挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a> 如何理解职场嫡系文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3219">53:39</a> 遭遇和领导的冲突怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">54:39</a> 职场性骚扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3676">61:16</a> 向领导做汇报的技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4009">66:49</a> 和领导意见不同的时候怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. Monday（窦靖童，春游）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 无人喝彩（小老虎，JULIANA）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，期待你的订阅、评论和来信，这是我们持续更新的动力！</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:UniverseBro@126.com"><span>UniverseBro@126.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信：Seashore_77</span></p>]]></description>
