  <item>
    <title>EP028 这就是心目中最好吃的城市（没有之一）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665a79c3ad5aa5d8c2d61ab8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665a79c3ad5aa5d8c2d61ab8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foj6UFz5Y7i6LrbdhdTAMuDX9bhb.webp"></figure><p><span>不维护家乡的美食是人成熟的标志，除了这座城市的人！宇宙兄弟提前祝大家端午安康~</span></p><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><p><span>When哥儿：在某互联网大厂“拧螺丝”</span></p><p><span>七昔：艰苦创业的脚后跟部网易音乐人</span></p><p><span>【本期摘要】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 汕头杜先生牛肉馆的隐藏菜单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> 香香甜甜的汕头广场老牌豆花 &nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a> 本地人的童年味道汕头无米粿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> 奇妙搭配的炸物汕头腐乳鸡翅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 真就不一样的汕头滨港猪脚饭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> 薄如蝉翼的汕头小吴肠粉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 米其林必比登广州穗银肠粉&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a> 豆腐鱼一绝的汕头汕樟烧烤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 三个帅老板的汕头东市白粥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2314">38:34</a> 汕头大排档旁边的柠檬茶 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 100多一杯的山竹汁很值得</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> 米其林必比登广州新文记</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">52:28</a> 米其林的星、叉匙和必比登</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3292">54:52</a> 米其林必比登广州吴财记</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a> 广州小马哥秘制羊肉串</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3545">59:05</a> 广州民记煲仔饭&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3682">61:22</a> &nbsp;蜜汁黑叉烧、灌汤脆皮烧鹅、咸蛋黄焗罗氏虾、龙虾贵妃泡饭、古法白鸡、松叶蟹刺身、黑金避风塘炒蟹、盐焗花螺（这些也好吃，我们下次聊）</span></p><p><span>【美食图鉴】</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiwaFYqI2ZCYHx7Lj_FD0nnh01qx.webp"></figure><p><span>杜先生牛肉馆</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fng5_8caWfh0HwQeofcguWVNlK02.jpg"></figure><p><span>酱汁百叶</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnV6xZCYtJLFcSR9bhsdkrEmo8gb.jpg"></figure><p><span>红糖豆花</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi_eHJ1IXztKTri9YuMaP3LyryG-.jpg"></figure><p><span>无米粿</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1OuEZCT79X3Jhq25mFjls-Ijv-.jpg"></figure><p><span>隆江猪脚饭</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_X6gq_6HDGtA8bzSUbsnEArvkC.jpg"></figure><p><span>小吴肠粉</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwVRLxFnqUwTxC2wEVNh57LWDp4.webp"></figure><p><span>穗银肠粉</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fodxa_DB9Ipa3jUW1r4PLwPl-g0J.jpg"></figure><p><span>汕樟烧烤</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llciNQXY43Tud0oIxiFd-bSVnrxG.jpg"></figure><p><span>东市白粥</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYCuIGLtvdhnpMQitBCn4Js1e-r.jpg"></figure><p><span>一杯山竹汁用掉一筐山竹</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkmVGwpO9vSgQcLQIXyEZy4Jgqpk.jpg"></figure><p><span>啫啫锅</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FodejLDglYYgoMPf23RRNpeSkQ6O.jpg"></figure><p><span>炒菜心</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuV5WDgQt3Pv0xF7CQQ_L67AJqW8.jpg"></figure><p><span>小马哥秘制烧烤</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPfu8T0oOzbmUu6vU-cEVqDQJ3N.jpg"></figure><p><span>煲仔饭</span></p><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><p><span>1. 我爱潮汕小吃（李绪杰，致妈妈）</span></p><p><span>2. 士多啤梨苹果橙（Twins，Magic）</span></p><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><p><span>感谢收听，期待你的订阅、评论和来信，这是我们持续更新的动力！</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:UniverseBro@126.com"><span>UniverseBro@126.com</span></a></p><p><span>微信：Seashore_77</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpqLFKMFFGJrpiLcUfgYk7d9-BBc.m4a" length="121032016" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtWS2vGysDOX7akoaJvUrP_yTihj.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP027 没有占星师回答不了的问题？玄得乎的就是了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664876aa251bd96e6c275eaa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664876aa251bd96e6c275eaa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6MFPVIHQqFhIDlMwKZLyQ7spa-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>今天请占星师Elika来集中回答一波大家关心的问题！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>七昔：艰苦创业的脚后跟部网易音乐人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Elika：职业占星师、塔罗师、芳疗师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期摘要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> Elika从这开始回答大家发来的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 为啥选择去意大利留学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">22:14</a> 意大利很快乐但学习也很卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 美好的意大利吃喝回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 米兰小酒吧的一款酒回国再没喝到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 当初没有想留在欧洲工作和生活吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a> 辗转于北京、米兰、上海、巴厘岛、沈阳的这几年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2191">36:31</a> &nbsp;Elika留下的重要提示，MARK住！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.米兰超好吃的那不勒斯风味餐厅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frg9t1GXet8mR2aj-hOUw5ECCkqV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.米兰小酒吧里的那款酒missionary downfall（在图片右下角）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqKHmiv-wa2VvNv07olhK3TsRNh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ci Sei E Se Non Ci Sei （Arisa，Amami）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，期待你的订阅、评论和来信，这是我们持续更新的动力！</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:UniverseBro@126.com"><span>UniverseBro@126.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信：Seashore_77</span></p>]]></description>
