  <item>
    <title>EP026 经济学硕士专攻玄学？魔法即是好好生活！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6648667782b428eafd69d276</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6648667782b428eafd69d276</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvkGDo2qZ7QJNrzv97HcQwCvBOVJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp8jta_RoA-6kAsWbV0e4r6QoW0j.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>今天给大家请来了一位魔法少女，打开她的主页介绍，你会马上看到占星师、塔罗师、图瓦萨满学徒这几个身份标签，她还是专业的芳疗师！闻到魔法的味道了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>七昔：艰苦创业的脚后跟部网易音乐人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Elika：职业占星师、塔罗师、芳疗师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期摘要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 普通人怎么辨别一个占星师、塔罗师的水平呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> Elika的玄学段位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 占星、塔罗和萨满都是咋回事儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a> 芳疗师是干啥的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 放弃金融搞玄学是怎么想的？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> 聊聊清华大学历史学博士占星师玛丽安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 你了解伦敦占星学院吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> 英国埃克塞特大学的魔法与神秘科学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 全职做玄学是什么概念？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> 玄学领域现在开始卷了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2512">41:52</a> &nbsp;我该如何成为一个专业的占星师？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. Hedwig’s Theme（John Williams，Harry Potter and the Philosopher’s Stone）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Starry Starry Night （Lianne La Havas，Loving Vincent）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，期待你的订阅、评论和来信，这是我们持续更新的动力！</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:UniverseBro@126.com"><span>UniverseBro@126.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信：Seashore_77</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhgMNFrrwomfr4TN1q4xU5SqjH7h.m4a" length="91196678" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FplUpsw42RkJN54Kcphltk7GtTVM.png"/>
